  "description": "<h4 data-end=\"192\" data-start=\"163\"><strong data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"168\">Brand Introduction</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"193\">YRA Swim is a <strong data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"207\">high-end swimwear brand</strong> designed for women who appreciate <strong data-end=\"323\" data-start=\"269\">luxury, exclusivity, and exceptional craftsmanship</strong>. Our collections embody <strong data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"348\">elegance, sophistication, and confidence</strong>, catering to trendsetters who seek <strong data-end=\"466\" data-start=\"428\">statement swimwear that stands out</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"501\" data-start=\"471\"><strong data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"476\">Product Description</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"502\">Our swimwear is crafted from <strong data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"531\">premium Italian and Brazilian fabrics</strong>, featuring <strong data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"584\">custom embellishments and couture-level craftsmanship</strong>. With <strong data-end=\"714\" data-start=\"648\">flattering cuts, high-quality materials, and intricate details</strong>, YRA Swim offers <strong data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"732\">a unique fusion of timeless design and modern allure</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"793\"><strong data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"798\">Unique Selling Points (USP)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"832\">\r\n<li data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"832\"><strong data-end=\"871\" data-start=\"834\">Luxury Without the Overpriced Tag</strong> &ndash; Premium quality at a price that remains accessible to those who value style and exclusivity.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"969\"><strong data-end=\"998\" data-start=\"971\">Exclusive Limited Drops</strong> &ndash; Our collections are <strong data-end=\"1042\" data-start=\"1021\">not mass-produced</strong>, making each piece highly sought-after.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1085\"><strong data-end=\"1120\" data-start=\"1087\">Celebrity &amp; Influencer Appeal</strong> &ndash; YRA Swim is worn by stylish, affluent women and influencers who embrace luxury fashion.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1213\"><strong data-end=\"1247\" data-start=\"1215\">Perfect for Content Creators</strong> &ndash; Our swimwear is <strong data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1266\">Instagram-worthy</strong>, designed to turn heads and drive engagement.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1335\"><strong data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1337\">Strong Brand Identity</strong> &ndash; YRA Swim stands for <strong data-end=\"1437\" data-start=\"1385\">elegance, exclusivity, and premium craftsmanship</strong>, making it an aspirational brand with high sales potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1545\" data-start=\"1501\"><strong data-end=\"1543\" data-start=\"1506\">Affiliate Program &amp; Payment Terms</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1546\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1635\" data-start=\"1546\"><strong data-end=\"1573\" data-start=\"1548\">High commission rates</strong> on every sale generated through your unique affiliate link.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1636\"><strong data-end=\"1664\" data-start=\"1638\">30-day cookie duration</strong> &ndash; Earn commissions on purchases made within a month of a customer clicking your link.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1809\" data-start=\"1753\"><strong data-end=\"1782\" data-start=\"1755\">Fast, reliable payments</strong> &ndash; No delays, no hassles.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1810\"><strong data-end=\"1831\" data-start=\"1812\">Exclusive perks</strong> &ndash; Early access to new collections, special discount codes, and potential gifting opportunities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1959\" data-start=\"1931\"><strong data-end=\"1957\" data-start=\"1936\">Other Information</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"2289\" data-start=\"1960\">We are looking for <strong